WEBVTT

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:31.976
Why are the truest compliments
and the sincerest sentiments

00:04:31.976 --> 00:04:33.978
said about people we love

00:04:33.978 --> 00:04:38.024
when they can't hear and savor
and relish them?

00:04:39.191 --> 00:04:43.988
And how do we honor all those around us
who are very much alive?

00:04:45.489 --> 00:04:49.285
So what if we turn regret on its head

00:04:49.285 --> 00:04:52.163
and take all that love
and conscientiousness

00:04:52.204 --> 00:04:55.750
that we habitually
express after people die

00:04:55.791 --> 00:04:58.002
and do it while they're still here?

00:04:58.919 --> 00:05:02.256
Because doing that eases the pain
of death and regret